{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "batch": 1566,
  "batch_count": 1701,
  "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
  "source_commit": "624b11ee6bac4894f9e1bac15c5037fc7d787286",
  "source_language": "zh-CN",
  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d50839ba54d750e12393a33",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很讲究柔顺剂的选择哦。味道很好闻吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76120ace87f24067ee51315b7ffde82dbead7fd89de1c7fe367c5b8c940de97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6f96ba12f83a784fae7f9312",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我平时就有在穿，已经习惯穿高跟鞋了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5759cec8484afbe574352a2b29c6e03440e8b6a070ac01d83566d96e9167b0f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70bb5dcad5a0cd034c47912f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比起花哨的颜色，我更喜欢沉稳的颜色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c14ef1b5dc2abb34d9b716fc0cb842c62d95693ce567291864cfe6a6ceef1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b3c130da3eaceceb2ecd5c9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5678f8103c098a9ab1d0880aff026b49c2b091d04989b44b2951242b05d12073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ef0ae6eb2280d9d13edf2a7a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尺寸看起来也没问题呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd8be34bd5697ad2bed0e899afa151e1f77e59108453382db9872e61b5b2f440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1116f676112a4629fcdb2703",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "折痕我都是用熨斗仔仔细细熨出来的哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1c914a00e836761ef35460a4c315af6a756f8b263fa5a080149f058fd361b654",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b029e95984a2bd7a32d0ac7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "站姿还是挺拔一点比较好吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a5dfea67f4c3e9b9639eebd5d552a9ad89bf2b2b843f50a336890e0bf37413fd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:908c0304c538598c64f09693",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿得整齐得体，这就叫做『气质』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "aaa020e4924ec5696841ee7a491841fa4de9e1b33a91f82239954dfab9474478",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4b24e16f4b486eb8d37d2ca",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "下摆散开的样子很漂亮呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7a9ffcff39d46c34ef2e465e027c6941ef51bbc6306ba333391de7f54d347dd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1c94f2d53365e1c979b0ebcc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很喜欢花朵的装饰。感觉心情都会变得明朗起来呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7753f270db0fe87bd672890e68ad5706a318927d26eec351606ff6458c66f752",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3521e4b8ec38dbfcc3e081de",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很讲究柔顺剂的选择哦。味道很好闻吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e76120ace87f24067ee51315b7ffde82dbead7fd89de1c7fe367c5b8c940de97",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:12409005fe3d0ab476b6c619",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我平时就有在穿，已经习惯穿高跟鞋了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5759cec8484afbe574352a2b29c6e03440e8b6a070ac01d83566d96e9167b0f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:417cbc50628df01f6806830c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "比起花哨的颜色，我更喜欢沉稳的颜色。",
      "source_fingerprint": "53c14ef1b5dc2abb34d9b716fc0cb842c62d95693ce567291864cfe6a6ceef1f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2fbc7229c9477dfeeaea2482",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这样的也不错呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5678f8103c098a9ab1d0880aff026b49c2b091d04989b44b2951242b05d12073",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:71e8a510f0bb7ac4a578c554",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "尺寸看起来也没问题呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd8be34bd5697ad2bed0e899afa151e1f77e59108453382db9872e61b5b2f440",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0f85e8d3d0fcb0ff1a581380",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦了",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd96bf364b8b21a3bb94efcf4ef82feb1bc34cf02203524e7949dbd19151dd13",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c67f5ce7ba56274a14e8eda3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安。为了不向太阳\r\n展现出羞耻的模样，今天\r\n也要挺直腰板去努力哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7574ff08f3b868d9611d8e30ae41d41cc8437f6835689f334b314ec91909b39",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e962174358044730b9355296",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我讨厌手忙脚乱的，所以\r\n总是早早地来学校。在安静的教室里\r\n待着，感觉很舒服呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "30753abb3f3dcf41f4018b5bc8eac76bcb9b0a4aa5759444e1aa2863ff2e8345",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d28af953f14f65bb9d085048",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你看上去好像很困呢。我去给你\r\n泡杯焙茶吧。正好\r\n我也想喘口气。",
      "source_fingerprint": "92c0744104734c5d051105a5918d09d3de4688b7a7021bfe2c1d5601f4e22ecf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4413b48ec57b023309d6273e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哈啊…黄金巨匠同学坐着的样子\r\n真是美丽啊…！挺直腰板像这样，笔直地——\r\n不对，是这样吗…？",
      "source_fingerprint": "de3e39d583cbd4b98860671369b6d94099ca3b609c956ee46831862536467048",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7c24304fe209c43ad992b77b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在老家的时候，弟弟妹妹总是\r\n在那里跑来跑去…我\r\n光顾着打扫卫生了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b67116c01bb5c93b2af275c96945893268e6a3d54455ca09a0bb67cfd2c37b5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:21b97e4539d5f6f0b9d94de0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（已经这个时候了…！？\r\n哈啊，上网搜自己名字真是个大坑啊…\r\n还是把手机收起来吧）",
      "source_fingerprint": "ded1c7bf426768fac8a0d466cda07d7a68a74b7bc88a99a3259fe57713dd6709",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f39e481feed20dbc61d2337",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是个好时节啊。天气温暖，\r\n当季的食物也很美味——闻着淡淡的\r\n花香，我的心也随之雀跃起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0a6636234bdb4a58e7b090d34185191b806166d5d10b20c2b02552ff63f44ddd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:539b46b49c99478b38d67a1a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（骗人的吧，又要下雨…？\r\n衣服、头发还有我的心情都湿漉漉的了…\r\n饶了我吧…哈啊…）",
      "source_fingerprint": "01f27b6b2d5ff4420e6826bbc04387ab7d20e008e66cca7a74a515cad1dbd063",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fa62ce290103164c21e0450a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年我也想去\r\n看红叶。一边欣赏风景一边喝杯\r\n热茶，是不是很有雅兴呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "cfad8116e53581894a254c8cf1509f31f30485c7fc7beaa8a1bb3ee80a44aca8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2a81fadb861f97b51bd39354",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（自助餐厅的关东煮，虽然好吃\r\n但是…唯独没有放土豆这一点，\r\n就不能想想办法吗…）",
      "source_fingerprint": "3dbd6648b988954902503cb970dd28dc8a1151a87c5e81f76c38e0fb97e70b23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c9ac2488d24714860171db0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐",
      "source_fingerprint": "9392c70765a5a96081978bc15cd29abd7d78628fdd8840f21389130a9a70469b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0b96658f116fb1706cfbe9d7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜欢花是受了母亲的影响呢。\r\n她在阳台上种了各种各样的花，\r\n我从以前就很喜欢眺望那些花。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c12a0d2a9af46e2107a75ebec121c9872d6911cab8e8dd968ba9b9c2d922a291",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722c4bdf78c05f9eb6d96ea9",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（出、出现了～～！创世驹同学\r\n那台大得夸张的火箭筒相机…！真的\r\n好大啊！看起来好吓人～～！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "ea70e4296bdca2ff948131861186540ee11b62c04e88602174806296047d1245",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:864d7f332ed9cf3b8f6d74e8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（本来打算擦擦宿舍房间的窗户的…\r\n结果今天又被信念同学抢先了。真是服了她了）",
      "source_fingerprint": "092494724ccc180fe5d9a4b7c394f646ed10a0852551a94ffebf48674660c033",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e6489fbeb9d911b12405115c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小唯爱今天喷的香水，\r\n真好闻啊…品味总是\r\n那么好啊。去问问她是在哪里买的吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "408490f615781a0b120cd04494dded8814e6a0be30b62d28cfa5846001402111",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:05e00cf6318175aeb4daf040",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阪神赛场，果然\r\n比任何地方都让我感到安心。…身心\r\n都能平静下来，发挥出实力。",
      "source_fingerprint": "86e688be263c270cc2b1e612a962d29eac5cd30c7191ad4401a5ad31a5dc3a60",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb02bc16a9286c1235258efe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "只要比任何人都凛然、昂首挺胸地绽放\r\n自然就能吸引所有的目光。\r\n——对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "582b8f79083f721b7182b42240cb319a6089d220253ab9c8ba50ef8e9078a9df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ec85d594b30a5ab588da2ddf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "每当听到声援，我的腰板就会\r\n自然地挺直。因为必须要让大家看到我\r\n美丽绽放的身姿才行…",
      "source_fingerprint": "59b74bfcbcf7fcc19c04c3ca45439c6e0e2295f0d4bd284c133eadadc7eac216",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:84e89449149d0a4abd95706e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "装饰在细节方面我也非常注意\r\n哦。只有在活动的时候，花朵才会显得\r\n像是绽放了一样…这样很时髦吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "91820114ad59881443c6a961fbbb89dfb973b9c69b17f82c8b19d91f14975244",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:75af380a9696892a88e8f463",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我稍微喷了点香水。\r\n淡淡的木犀花香…总是\r\n能让我振奋起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "3d6176c80521deba836f1dd66124c09c680f97b051f048bc27232e451db1fe23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36e96fa2436677fedb896385",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（小杏，不管怎么说这起得\r\n也太早了吧…你真的有好好睡觉吗？\r\n我也起得够早了哦…？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "b783e2ef101fbd5ecbc6223c4534b9fa2390d140643282041839fb9a2355899e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:780e42c2d3befa13f10c4ce7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（黄金旅程前辈，突然晃悠过来\r\n给了我颗糖…为什么？难道说\r\n她把我当成小孩子了吗？）",
      "source_fingerprint": "bce9d54c628d74b9bff7145abdda3c4a94897e44e3f26498a374db700e629d54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8a6dfba09b2b4433e911978b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天想去我们宿舍玩，\r\n防爆装束同学这么邀请我了。…呵呵，\r\n她笑着那么对我说，我根本没法拒绝啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a72484c9d301f875eb024c1db0297fe2f89c835fab283829d9c2dae6909948f8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:97be46c5be587702427fb321",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀，鼻子怎么抽抽搭搭的…\r\n我有纸巾，给你一张吧。\r\n不过带点香味，可以吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "4644f52439eedb1e51ec3abd4e1c6fd61fb3f950e531398b567d3ce0e6526637",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4aec762cfdab7f55c3c85130",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "穿着浴衣在外面散步，只有夏天才能做到\r\n今年也想去呢…穿着木屐，\r\n发出喀哒喀哒的声音。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1bdb2efb255a8860cf23f1e700013709722b00ecd7cfb5104e9730d9ee8c298e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cbdff1cee6ba73b969cff22",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（早知道就带件厚外套\r\n来了…！？根本不知道穿什么衣服合适…\r\n真是个麻烦的季节啊！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "1ca78064e70084db7225e1eef713d7576a90a522b8baabc8d7864f08dfbe0533",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab665f855a280516a7e7a676",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "说到冬天的装扮那就是靴子了吧。\r\n只要穿上就能显得很熟练，\r\n而且也很方便实用呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1b57a28af63f8479da38b9745aa779855094d6b5570f1e0bbad4cb6094938994",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:77317525aaa1780ddf1a0ccf",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今天也按部就班地开始吧。\r\n不要着急，一步一个脚印。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95c230cd00dc88effe051f36caa7db5148bd78cfa5752b7a3ca4e5ac46015187",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:34d8a2b37f562836be1c4ee3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好晴朗的天空，好舒服的风。…呵呵，\r\n感觉它们就像在背后\r\n推着我前进一样，真开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8e362b911114e52702e48b374e8b4db10c1392236dd8ec138250b5e5184bbcda",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba179662b88e6e5ec7a9c128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我把想做的事情，都总结在\r\n笔记本上了。能麻烦你\r\n稍微看一下吗？",
      "source_fingerprint": "17cbdfa954d19471244a3c63b146dc34df31328632ec0c5b129dc88f65e1ab57",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:203ac1c0d002c38685e55498",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "（谁啊…！刚才，像忍者一样\r\n跑过去的是——…，\r\n不行，现在是在人前，要忍住…！）",
      "source_fingerprint": "782984334fb9d437ca8ca36090a8ea585729847a3857bf5ec00c0d3b533da2fb",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "92003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:316587a1553e9e9f7a3de93e",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "因为周围有人，我本来打算忍住的\r\n但实在是不行了——呐，你手里\r\n拿的那个假鼻子眼镜，到底是什么鬼…！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "a7c9c7f3c07260a56bfc96d4c957e1041c47dab70a87ce20c54118a19d2a38e3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "92005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:486b1e14646c15890a457a24",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "…等一下。那个，我还以为\r\n只是个普通的收纳盒——仔细一看\r\n这不就是个脸盆嘛！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e6ff3068fba268a47d1b0558f9a49a37138494a938cb9e1155087c4c84e60532",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "92006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a7c231dec50bbe5b28d39931",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我投降了，对你那装傻的毅力！\r\n…真是的，不管过多久\r\n都不肯消停啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d86942d458e47f857f90b2fa95dee8fb41f9d8671c0703e62b0bc088bd3424d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "92007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:108133b98191a97da8664125",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "像向日葵那样的夏日之花也\r\n很不错呢。不仅漂亮，还\r\n充满活力…能让人获得力量呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "dadd99fbffc17bfa5fa83b7cf07b38ac101b7d855f73a519f896fd92a286cf80",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "92011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:56e902893c0920b1bbf1239a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "能让我如此闪耀…真是最棒的搭档呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "309585c16eca778db98ee5c1e9a84e44d281f99196f81a684c40b11f310101d0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "93000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:418c242a4fb190c70a8b6e94",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你真是让我笑得很开心呢，真的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "44c0acd9fbddab490c87e7bb90cc5b9889244f0e75c76ea426736c00285dd912",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "93001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1af3ef6dfeeefe4d103ec719",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会绽放得更加盛大。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d5394f46f0fa1eb64389b8a189e2e13ea3941e40928d2cbf2b5368df5ad51176",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "95000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9de0fb5da91a6119eea76d9a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "继续朝着更高处，努力吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "6c819c8c694b802cba35273732759582d8d37e73ae53b9f767aa7d619af5de86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "95001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15cf919b2407ee6ff5e00f97",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我叫旺紫丁。请多指教。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8d1f32aba521cf4b171a710f6c31818673d9edc34bb3085f1570e6c975714e5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "95003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:820575ee7626b632909c1e40",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在寒冬中忍耐的紫丁香——\r\n就让绚烂的花雪，飞舞起来吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "16d6f305f364ca7278d8086045319575bdfca67fe6193caf9f0d5aef54bf054c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "95004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:128c2ab7f5da8989c681ec25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘛，也就这种程度吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "36af851c319bc2e198e2be7c81435e21e337db71a388f1a61399aa6f5b78020c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "95005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bbdcd244d8bf5d653e191d17",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呵呵，这种程度只是基本素养罢了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "e36ec8bfa65af8a7cb72bb5db0e0aced63d9064f448cb91dcd48afb7c0ec1362",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1130",
        "95006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3210be067235b1f9e71e2f4",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，去赢下比赛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1577dd77e575ab25a3d8e70ad9a0d219fb75f8c7467372878632d31d35e2e48f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:060bb5fa353c82dcf4fb3deb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "正因为与你一起，才能看见。\r\n称霸三种距离的光景……呵呵。真期待\r\n总有一天会迎来的“那一天”呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f27abdb11339a7cc0c891458932df14230b1f189a8b6ddd805905e058aa86ef0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0a27329246b76634879334",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我出发了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "874e7497e7be8367a4f334f4c7f1d69916bd93469660e8935829876ff0311191",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "100000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a69a14975a35064c57f7fefe",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我回来啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "cdcca0a999319539ad9640b8787eee70f6962f780c51356ce460851b0dce71db",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "100001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c664d4d7343da10b916da4eb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不安和不满也一定要告诉彼此！这也是\r\n英里规则！所以我要说……\r\n信任度100英里☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "5ba24dc5f648c44b0c5cbf0dc595312dc1d8a51afdb75675991b6a37ded50bd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:36b8a28fc96b0239031c5f20",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "嘿嘿♪我刚刚看见了，你\r\n正在积攒英里！\r\n……我们一起，去南方的岛屿吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e19d4f7d6cb962d63f79f3d88eb745d6aa84b734bcf349ad53a72db6267dc513",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a70440e8f461897159ffb55a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "新年快乐！\r\n……好，英里规则完成！我早就决定\r\n第一个祝福的人要是训练员了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "fab763cedbdbeaf12cac5ce085aa1cce721f73dd67b38cc33eb6096c9499b724",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9385f53c84d38dcb4ddd7d4a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "做好啦～！一颗就能补充跑0.1英里\r\n所需热量的\r\n巧克力！待会儿分给你一些！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e66cc8cc429c015cd6c194378ae88af49fe584a95a47d245beeb83162b673a96",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d6d104dbf59cf80064ae2f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我会努力亲手做巧克力的！\r\n因为……嘿嘿☆想融入的心意，\r\n足足有无限英里呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "573237cda3cc4e4e6f39735bb10c1528d13b9eb5d2fd1307f19d1741c1efa7ff",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3dccdcb28645bbcf936ac08",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在许愿笺上写报告而不是愿望\r\n就是我的英里规则！嗯，今年该报告哪件\r\n“已经完成的事”呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "7e7008a959dc8d703c0f7129fd4d99c15594fbed05dcf9e2e2e7e4cf19debc28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d09781490e45cfcd3f4467dd",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一时得意，吃了好多\r\n零食！要跑多少英里\r\n才能消耗掉这些能量呢？",
      "source_fingerprint": "c8b57b9a0f8eb46393a85a9d6964ecd1923cd006901648a6ebce23235135a9f1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:652ce7e2c549f25bd0069187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "圣诞节的时候，妈妈总会把工作，\r\n提前结束！\r\n呵呵……全家一起吃晚饭，真期待♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "201c17b4d32c51519c566fcce90a52fccfd16621817709f074ff11c9acb1bec5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a94a5567da636b8377f0362",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "接下来有时间吗？\r\n可以的话，希望你腾出时间☆\r\n灯饰，我想和你一起看！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d91e893efe829be8e7f1be80705818757fe4ed7043c856551eb14fefe4b0b806",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d48b3c81e269329723f1cbcb",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "喜悦100英里！",
      "source_fingerprint": "0311fb222f095c131a3bbf2eadc1881482d2d03551ff4f72cc199fe3f40a91a7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "1001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:121fbd763c8dd50b8659da76",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "今年跑了多少英里呢……\r\n明年我要跑上10倍英里，\r\n所以请看着我吧☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "684584ca793e4e7f9ae3da8884799e6a91ec21982320b4c2bd3f118955b96a86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b4c5369502c3af0e55ac3e4f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日一转眼就结束了呢。\r\n感觉比英里赛还快……\r\n不如明天也继续庆祝？",
      "source_fingerprint": "af13cfb7358cef72ed91296045549afa3e78b50e40f361ce1e12ab4a26603ed1",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6d47cc57d11cd52032a0049",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "来，去生日派对的会场！\r\n我要让你深刻体会……我\r\n究竟有多少英里想为你庆祝！",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1ece40c80f25c29dc3422c50a4e450450b4acaf97f68497bf20eeb1569bdeb0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:324e26ef57f86b1c53c0e854",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "生日时，大家带我去玩了\r\n障碍挑战！有适当的\r\n难度，真好玩～♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bffc46fcb4e0cf3adbe135481e114f21120f7b82876e3705deb1bcf29c9f66f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:62e28b15db6f5fbc8f16020b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇！你要为我庆祝生日吗？\r\n……嘿嘿，怎么办！高兴得\r\n连英里也形容不出来了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "998259dd36604e19b63d21aa144b6b018d56fa6d59857791766d552ac11b6f40",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b63aa395406eeee77f373f80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "啊，有通知哦！\r\n不好奇吗？\r\n大概10英里☆",
      "source_fingerprint": "288f87ecb03d16505df5eef1442996428f3418ac9443d80a9266a7454d2f91c3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a795ac2332298b467cc58be",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哇，是礼物！\r\n说不定拿到了英里积分！\r\n嘿嘿～，快打开看看吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "78e70b49ac5e021021030d85387a50df032bbe965ef1106c82ce6c9a601caa47",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1131",
        "10016"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
